<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oxford Resources.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oxford Resources.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities Analyst Jordan Hymowitz raised his rating on Oxford Resources Corp from HOLD to BUY.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, Jordan said he expects the company to earn $1.44 per share in Calendar Year 1996 and $1.70 per share in Calendar Year 1997. His six-month target price is $31, or approximately 41% above current levels.</p>
<p>-- Oxford Resources Corp. is primarily engaged in the business of leasing motor vehicles, servicing the leases during their terms and remarketing the vehicle upon expiration of the leases.</p>
</text>
